Real-Time Hand Tracking Mouse Control 🖱️✋
Welcome to the Real-Time Hand Tracking Mouse Control project! This cutting-edge Python-based system enables you to control your computer’s mouse and perform actions such as left-click, right-click, scroll, and drag-and-drop—all with intuitive hand gestures. Powered by MediaPipe, OpenCV, and PyAutoGUI, this project offers a seamless and interactive way to control your device. 🎉

🔑 Key Features:
Smooth Mouse Control 🖱️
Effortlessly move the cursor in real-time by pointing your index finger.

Left-Click 👆
Simulate a left-click by joining your middle finger and index finger together.

Right-Click 👉
Perform a right-click by pinching your thumb and pinky finger.

Scroll 🔄
Use a fist gesture to scroll up and down the screen.

Drag-and-Drop 🧳
Simulate a drag-and-drop action by pinching your thumb and index finger.

Gesture Mode Toggle 🔄
Switch between Mouse Mode and Gesture Mode to control actions with ease.

Real-Time Performance ⚡
Low-latency and smooth interactions, ensuring responsive control.

💻 Installation Guide:
1. Clone the repository:
bash
git clone https://github.com/ParthTarange/hand-tracking-mouse-control.git
cd hand-tracking-mouse-control

2. Install the required dependencies:
bash
pip install opencv-python mediapipe pyautogui

3. (Optional) Create and activate a Virtual Environment:
bash
python -m venv venv

# For Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# For macOS/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate
🚀 How to Use:
Run the Python script:

bash

python hand_tracker.py
Once running, your camera will be activated, and you can control the mouse with your hand gestures!

✋ Gesture Control:
Index Finger: Move the cursor smoothly across the screen.

Thumb + Index Pinch: Perform a Left-Click.

Thumb + Pinky Pinch: Perform a Right-Click.

Fist Gesture: Scroll up or down by making a fist.

Pinch Thumb & Index: Drag items on the screen.

Press 'q' to exit the program when you're done.

🔄 Gesture Mode:
Switch between Mouse Mode and Gesture Mode by performing specific hand gestures. You can easily customize and configure gestures based on your preferences.

🛠️ Customization:
This system is designed with flexibility in mind, allowing you to adjust settings and enhance its capabilities:

Smoothness Control: Fine-tune the smoothness of the cursor's movement.

Add More Gestures: Extend gesture control to trigger additional actions, like launching applications or adjusting system settings.

Keyboard Shortcuts: You can integrate keyboard actions (e.g., media control) for a fully interactive experience.


